>**Raises nation's Funds and Morale at the cost of {p:Supplies|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Supplies}.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Receive the mission from {n:Hieronymus}.
* Join {p:Campaign Battles|Category:Campaign Battle} in {p:Dark Kindred|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Kindred} controlled areas.
* After completing the Objective, report back to {n:Hieronymus} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* To complete this mission you MUST participate in Campaign battles in Beastmen controlled zones.
* You need 5000 EXP to complete this Campaign Op.
* You will receive your mission reward along with the Campaign battle assessment immediately after your objective has been completed.

=2 Objective
The Republic has set plans in motion to carry out attacks on Beastman Confederate strongholds in a series of strategic Campaign battles. Assist the troops of the 7th Cohors in the siege of these key tactical positions.
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
